{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-058", "score": 0.162, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-058 | Study family SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- observed_research_question: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.\n- observed_result: 2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: null"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-030", "score": 0.144, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-030 | Study family SF-APPA-030: Play-type label backfill verification\n- observed_research_question: Play-type label backfill verification\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Backfilled play-type labels match expected league distributions and team identities.\n- observed_result: PNR 28.7% FAIL (band 20-28%); PULL_UP 7.9% FAIL; 3100 games with team PNR >33% FAIL; PNR PPP 0.948 PASS; temporal PASS; team identity FAIL; 2024-25 PULL_UP ~0-1% for many teams. Final: FAIL.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: 2024-25 PULL_UP shares 0.0-2.0% for many teams; 82.8% of PNR labels proxy_calibrated.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 921,514 possessions\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-001\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-005"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022", "score": 0.14, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-022 | Study family SF-APPM-022: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.\n- observed_result: Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.\n- observed_sample_and_power: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-009", "score": 0.133, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-009 | Study family SF-CHT-009: Superstar suppression by lineup and forced play type\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression by lineup and forced play type\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Named star initiators have identifiable lineup and forced-play-type suppressors in the possession graph.\n- observed_result: Jokic vs MIN lineup PPP 0.814, -0.385 (n=59); Curry vs HOU 0.851, -0.358 (n=47); Doncic vs LAC 0.733, -0.396 (n=30); Giannis forced PULL_UP 0.848, -0.540 vs preferred DRIVE (largest gap).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE\n- observed_failure_evidence: No placebo or matching; later sequence work treated similar star-chain gaps as artifacts.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n>=30 for lineup cells cited\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Jokic/Curry/Doncic/Giannis; min-15 gate on 8 play types; opposing DEFENSE_LINEUP ~84% coverage; 272-row CSV."}], "n_results": 4}

